  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "トレーナーを　うしなった　ポケモンが\nはいっている　ボール。　トレーナーは\nウラウラじま　しゅっしん　らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "트레이너를 잃은 포켓몬이\n들어 있는 볼. 트레이너는\n울라울라섬 출신인 듯하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這個精靈球裡面裝了\n失去訓練家的寶可夢。\n訓練家似乎來自烏拉烏拉島。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Poké Ball contenant un Pokémon dont le\nDresseur a disparu. Il semblerait que ce Dresseur\nsoit originaire d’Ula-Ula.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Pokéball enthält ein Pokémon, das seinen\nTrainer verloren hat. Dieser stammt wohl aus\nUla-Ula.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poké Ball que alberga un Pokémon que perdió a su\nEntrenador, al parecer, natural de Ula-Ula.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poké Ball contenente un Pokémon rimasto orfano\ndell’Allenatore. Sembra che l’Allenatore fosse\noriginario di Ula Ula.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poké Ball with a Pokémon that lost its Trainer\ninside. It seems to be from Ula’ula Island.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "トレーナーを　失った　ポケモンが\n入っている　ボール。　トレーナーは\nウラウラ島　出身　らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "该精灵球里面装的是没有了\n训练家的宝可梦。那位训练家\n好像是出生自乌拉乌拉岛。",
